    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "“Victoria (…) is like a hug that whispers “courage”. (…) it flies a hugely uplifting flag for life, for dreams and for caring.” Mary Brennan, The Herald, Edinburgh, Scotland, 2007   Victoria is based on an original idea and texts by Charles Fariala, a production of Dulcinea Langfelder & Co.   In the work Victoria, Montreal’s acclaimed Dulcinea […]"
