        "@value": "Simply the best guitar showcase in the world   International Guitar Night After the resounding success of last year’s show, the Massey is thrilled to again present the critically acclaimed International Guitar Night.   Germany’s Gypsy Jazz legend Lulo Reinhardt will return as the show’s host and will be joined by three new guitarists: Calum Graham, […]"
