    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Exhibition “Two Different Views” by Jacky Hosford, December 1st to 24th There are so many concepts of what represents art it is often hard to choose a preference. I hoped to present several views on art with well known media such as oil, acrylic and ink in different formats, such as the fun of […]"
