        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The Exhibition &quot;Two Different Views&quot; by Jacky Hosford, December 1st to 24th There are so many concepts of what represents art it is often hard to choose a preference. I hoped to present several views on art with well known media such as oil, acrylic and ink in different formats, such as the fun of &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
