    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Arts Council and Massey Theatre presentation On the eve of retirement a middle class, judgmental snob discovers her husband has been having an affair with her best friend and is forced into exile with her bohemian sister who lives on an impoverished inner-city council estate. Director: Richard Loncraine Writers: Meg Leonard, Nick Moorcroft Stars: Joanna […]"
      }
