      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Original Legends of R-n-R presents Rock ‘n’ Soul Christmas! The Legends of Rock n’ Roll presents the music of world-class tribute acts performing a collection of hit songs from the greatest Rock’n’Soul artists of all-time… together with the Legends all-star band featuring “Mr Sax” Johnny Ferriera! Garry Moore returns to Canada as Little Richard… and […]"
