    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Cuba sings, dances and lives! This show highlights in an attractive, colorful and dynamic way, a tour of Cuba, its roots, its dances and its music; protagonists of the precise movement and the incalculable cadence: bulerías, seguidilla, chachachá, mambo, rumba, conga, bolero, feeling, all the rhythms that make the heart vibrate and fill the soul. &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
