    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;As part of the required curriculum of most art schools, life drawing is a requisite. The human figure is a very challenging subject to portray. I personally find it very challenging and I have been doing it for sixty years. Many years ago I got caught drawing a nude woman by my grade six teacher. &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
