        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Arts Council of New Westminster and Massey Theatre Society present You Are Here – A Come From Away Story. This is an intimate feature documentary that goes deep into the community of Gander, Newfoundland where 38 airliners carrying over 6,500 passengers were forced to land after the terrorist attacks on 9/11. The film pulls back […]"
