    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Consulate General of India, Vancouver is hosting ‘Namaste Canada 2019’ a day-long cultural event, in cooperation with over 25 Indo-Canadian Associations and Cultural Societies. The objective of this annual event is to celebrate India’s rich and vibrant cultural heritage to further strengthen the flourishing ties between India and Canada, and to present to our local […]"
