    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Massey Theatre is thrilled to again present International Guitar Night – an evening of exquisite guitar music highlighting the diversity of acoustic guitar. This year’s tour has the most eclectic lineup yet; it includes Mike Dawes from England and his incredible two-hand contemporary style and is joined by fretless guitarist from Turkey, Cenk Erdoğan; electrifying […]"
