    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The Massey Theatre is thrilled to again present International Guitar Night – an evening of exquisite guitar music highlighting the diversity of acoustic guitar. This year’s tour has the most eclectic lineup yet; it includes Mike Dawes from England and his incredible two-hand contemporary style and is joined by fretless guitarist from Turkey, Cenk Erdoğan; electrifying &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
