    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Arts Council of New Westminster and Massey Theatre present The Tomorrow Man as part of Last Monday at the Movies. Ed Hemsler spends his life preparing for a disaster that may never come. Ronnie Meisner spends her life shopping for things she may never use. In a small town somewhere in America, these two people […]"
