      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Experience the magic of the Nutcracker this holiday season with the Royal City Youth Ballet’s full length ballet now celebrating their 29th season! Featuring a cast of 70+ dedicated and enthusiastic dancers under the artistic direction of Camilla Fishwick-Kellogg.  There are magical soldiers, dueling mice, a Sugar Plum Fairy, along with audience favourites Snowflakes, Snow King […]"
