    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;‘Think Different’Presented by New Westminster Secondary School Fine Arts Program This annual collaboration between New Westminster Secondary School Fine Arts Program and the Plaskett Gallery is the work in a variety of mediums from current NWSS students. This exhibition is a showcase of young and emerging talent in a variety and broad range of styles, &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
