        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;New Westminster Secondary School\\'s Musical Theatre Program - School\\'s Out Productions - proudly presents Disney\\'s Beauty and the Beast from February 26-29 at Massey Theatre. This &quot;tale as old as time&quot; is sure to wow audiences with its colourful and dazzling display of fantastical dance numbers, comedic banter, and crowd-pleasing music. The story emphasizes the &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
