    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Liminal Space is where transformation takes place. It is the time between what was and what will be next. When one has the potential to act, but has not yet done so. This process of waiting, not knowing what will become, is part of the process that we must patiently embrace – letting it form […]"
