        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Raven's Eye 2020 by Kevin Stewart | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Artist Statement: When I was six years old, in my Grade One school class, we were making cards for Mother’s Day, rather we were colouring in stencilled pictures of a 50’s style white Mom. I didn’t know we were supposed to only colour in the lines. I was more concerned about the colours I was […]"
      }
