        "@value": "Raven&#8217;s Eye 2020 by Kevin Stewart"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Artist Statement: When I was six years old, in my Grade One school class, we were making cards for Mother’s Day, rather we were colouring in stencilled pictures of a 50’s style white Mom. I didn’t know we were supposed to only colour in the lines. I was more concerned about the colours I was &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
