        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;For the past month, artists of a fantastic range of disciplines have been performing to small audiences in the Plaskett Gallery as part of our Plaskett Limited program. All the artists are returning to perform on stage at Massey Theatre in a showcase/pandemic reflection event featuring MC Allan Morgan. These performances will offer the artists &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
