        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;We\\'re thrilled to announce iconic Canadian songstress Chantal Kreviazuk is coming to the Massey as part of our Fall 2020 Concerts programming for four incredible shows. Shows are on October 28, 29, 30 and 31. All shows are at 7:30 pm. Chantal Kreviazuk – one of Canada’s most accomplished songwriters and recognizable voices –released her &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
