        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Fans of Monty Python, Mr. Bean, and Dr. Seuss… Grab your teacups! Off-Broadway Comedians and 3-time IMPRESARIO Award-Winners (London) James &amp; Jamesy present their outrageously funny and brilliantly inventive Christmas comedy classic O Christmas Tea — an astonishing show that delights thousands of hearts every holiday season. When catastrophe strikes at James and Jamesy’s Christmas &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
