    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The always exceptional International Guitar Night returns to the Massey Theatre with a dynamic and eclectic lineup of international acoustic guitarists. Four guitar virtuosos take the stage displaying their individual eclectic styles and then perform together captivating the audience with an evening of guitar perfection. This year’s guitarists encompass a range of styles featuring acoustic […]"
