        "@value": "Shuang Music School and partners presents Melody of Love at the Massey Theatre on May 22, 2022, 3pm. Come celebrate the musical achievements of our talented youth in an afternoon of music and dance, with proceeds in benefit of the Burnaby Hospital Foundation. The concert will feature ensemble performances and arrangements of popular, Chinese-folk and […]"
