    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Frank Pochyly was born November 21, 1966 in the tiny town of Ash in what is now known as the Czech Republic. In 1969 the Pochyly family left their apartment and belongings in Frantiskovy Lazne and defected to Canada. They first resided amongst the beautiful surroundings of Oak Bay, Vancouver Island and then moved to […]"
