    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Artist Statement: It was my maternal grandmother who taught me to quilt. Not the easiest grandchild to teach because I am left-handed, and she wasn’t. She tried gamely to switch but eventually gave it up and taught me the only way she could. To this day, all of my handwork is done with my right […]"
