        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The Final Canadian Physique Alliance Show of the 2022 Season will take place November 12th at the Massey Theatre in New Westminster, BC This Level 1 open show is open to all competitors across canada in; Bodybuilding,Classic Physique,Physique, Figure,Bikini,Fitness &amp; Wellness Categories. This event is promoted by Xtreme Promotions, Dean &amp; Leigh Brandt Master of &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
