        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;A NEW PLAY People with Disabilities Transforming Attitudes about and Experiences with Employment Collectively created by artists with disabilities and the team that brought you Romance, Relationships &amp; Rights! ABOUT THE PLAY: People with disabilities deserve to work! Follow the dramatized stories of individuals with disabilities (self-advocates) and their experiences navigating employment. Get a glimpse &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
