    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "This is an exhibition of Chinese Ink Paintings created by Wenyan Xu. Wenyan Xu was born in Shaanxi, China. She is a Chinese landscape painter. She learned to paint from her father. She has exhibited in Canada and abroad. She moved to Vancouver in 2018 and has exhibited in international galleries. She is a member […]"
