    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "For its 31st season, Royal City Musical Theatre presents: Crazy For You. The story in a nutshell: stage struck Bobby Child (Todd Talbot) works as a banker but has a desire to be a singer/dancer on Broadway and spends his off hours practicing dance routines. He is sent to Nevada to foreclose on a theatre […]"
