    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The West Coast Tap Dance Collective presents Time Steps, May 27th @ The Massey Theatre.   Time Steps is an all-tap-dancing show featuring professional and amateur tap dancers and live music.   Each year West Coast Tap recognizes National Tap Dance Day, the birthday of Bill ‘Bojangles’ Robinson, with a celebration that brings the local […]"
