      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Presented by NWSS Dance Join the NWSS Dance program as they celebrate almost 20 years of Dance Shows at the Massey Theatre!   Senior Dancers Present “Wreck-It Ralph”. Arcade-game character Wreck-It Ralph is tired of always being the “Bad Guy”. After decades of seeing all the glory go to his “Good Guy” opponent, Fix-It Felix, Ralph […]"
