    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "PRESENTED BY MOON COIN PRODUCTIONS Escape the Summer heat inside of a cool theatre enjoying the music of one of the most iconic bands of our time! Moon Coin Productions (Producers of ABRA Cadabra) Presents “Take It To The Limit” The Ultimate Eagle’s Tribute coming to The Massey Theatre for the first time on July 20th, 2023! This show features […]"
