      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Presented by Simply The Best Talent TINA TURNER – The Queen of Rock N’ Roll Show – starring Luisa Marshall As seen on Oprah and ELLEN – World Rock N Roll Tribute Artist Champion Luisa Marshall performs her spectacular show with her band. Her uncanny resemblance to Tina Turner paved the way for her world class tribute act with rave reviews […]"
