        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Presented by the International Punjabi Folk Arts Society The World Folk Festival 2023, a grand celebration of cultural diversity and the vibrant spirit of Bhangra, is set to take place on October 6th in the vibrant city of New Westminster. Experience an ode to the exhilarating world of Bhangra, where dancers, enthusiasts, and artists from &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
