    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "PRESENTED BY STRANGE ADVANCE Strange Advance and Spoons, those 80’s new wave legends play BC together for the first time! Armed with Gold Records, hit songs and Juno nominations, they will take you back to the best days of your lives. Spoons are a hit-making machine with songs like Nova Heart, Tell No Lies, Old […]"
