        "@value": "BUY TICKETS Pre-order your refreshments for pre-show and intermission here!   A Frank Sinatra Appreciation Event PRESENTED BY MICHAEL VAN DEN BOS 150 minutes (includes 15-minute intermission) In the pantheon of preeminent 20th-century pop vocalists, one name remains king of the hill, top of the heap: FRANK SINATRA.  With his ability to easily swivel between […]"
