        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A Toast To 75 Years | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "On December 16, 1949, the first performance was on the Massey Theatre stage and what a day it was! We will be having a community gathering to kick off a year of celebrations of 75 years of Massey Theatre on December 16. From 6-9pm, the Makers Alley will be open featuring local artisan and makers […]"
      }
    ],
