        "@value": "Krystle Dos Santos: A Night of Soul with Bradley Barkman"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Ticket prices: Student/Senior: $27 (plus s/c) Adult: $37 (plus s/c) BUY TICKETS Pre-order your refreshments for pre-show and intermission here! &nbsp; Presented by Eighth &amp; Eight Creative Spaces Joined by guest artist Bradley Barkman, experience an electrifying journey down memory lane with Krystle Dos Santos and her dynamic 3pc band! Prepare to dance the night &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ]
