        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Ticket prices: 4 day pass: $17.00 plus s/c Competitors, Seniors and Students may attend at no charge BUY TICKETS Pre-order your refreshments for pre-show and intermission here! &nbsp; Presented by Global Dance Services Inc.  Celebrating 18 years of youth dance in British Columbia. This four day event showcases up and coming talent in a variety &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
