      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Ticket prices: All prices include service charges and taxes P1: $185.05 P2: $139.05 P3: $134.05 P4: $104.05 P5: $95.05 P6: $84.05 P7: $73.05 Students, seniors and kids under 10, Use Code STUDENT to get 10% off. Prices are subject to change at any time. &nbsp; BUY TICKETS Pre-order your refreshments for pre-show and intermission here! &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
